        "articleHeadline": "8.716 kasus campak per minggu ke-9, Kemenkes gencarkan imunisasi",
        "articleHeadlineTranslated": "8,716 measles cases in Week 9, Ministry of Health ramps up immunization.",
        "articleBody": "",
        "affectedCategories": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "humans"
