        "publishedTimestamp": "2026-03-14T02:42:25+00:00",
        "articleHeadline": "'ราชทัณฑ์' แจง 'แอมป์ ณวรรษ' ผู้ต้องขังคดี ม.112 ไม่ได้ป่วย 'ฝีดาษลิง-อีสุกอีใส' | เดลินิวส์",
        "articleHeadlineTranslated": "The Department of Corrections clarifies that 'Amp Nawat', the inmate charged under Section 112, is not ill with monkeypox or chickenpox | Daily News.",
        "articleBody": "",
        "affectedCategories": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "humans"
          }
        ],
        "articleSummary": "Amp Nawat, a detainee under Section 112 at Bangkok Special Prison, is not infected with monkeypox or chickenpox, the Department of Corrections clarified after social-media posts claimed otherwise. He has been in custody since July 2, 2024. On March 7, 2026, prison nurses found a cellulitis lesion on his left ankle and two red bumps on his right thigh, with mild tenderness and no fever, and he was placed in isolation pending medical review. An on-duty physician determined there were no signs of monkeypox or varicella and allowed him to leave isolation. On March 11, 2026, staff explained the diagnosis to him, continued treatment and daily wound care at the prison clinic, and confirmed his understanding and lack of anxiety. The Department emphasizes that all detainees receive medical care, with ongoing monitoring and external-hospital transfer if needed, under humane treatment and strict infection-control standards.",
        "articleId": "aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZGFpbHluZXdzLmNvLnRoL25ld3MvNTY4NjA1MS8="
      },
      "triage": {
        "headline_ja": "矯正局が説明、第112条違反で拘留中の「アンプ・ナワット」はmpox（サル痘）・水痘には罹患していない | デイリーニュース",
        "triage_verdict": "DISMISS",
        "triage_reason": "SNS上の誤情報に対する公式否定であり、実際の感染症発生イベントではない。医療機関による診察の結果、mpoxおよび水痘の兆候は認められず、蜂窩織炎と診断されている。",
        "ihr_criteria": {
          "serious_impact": "No",
          "unusual_unexpected": "No",
          "international_spread": "No",
          "travel_trade_restriction": "No",
