        "articleHeadline": "एक लापरवाही और यमराज बन गया रेबीज! 17 साल के छात्र की हालत देख डॉक्टर भी हैरान; अब बचने की उम्मीद नहीं",
        "articleHeadlineTranslated": "One act of negligence, and rabies has become the Grim Reaper! Doctors are also stunned by the condition of the 17-year-old student; there is now no hope of survival.",
