        "articleSummary": "Manohar allegedly injected HIV-infected blood into a young woman in Annojiguda, Medchal-Malkajgiri district, near Hyderabad, after she refused to marry him. The engagement had been withdrawn when the woman's family learned that Manohar and some relatives were HIV positive. On March 11, he allegedly forced a syringe injection of his HIV-positive blood; the woman developed a high fever and was treated at a private hospital. She disclosed the assault to the Pocharam IT Corridor police, who registered a case. Manohar was detained on March 14 and produced in court for judicial remand. Investigations are ongoing to determine the sequence of events and circumstances. The incident highlights violence linked to matrimonial proposals and potential HIV exposure, with authorities examining medical and legal implications.",
