        "articleSummary": "On 2026-03-15, NTDTV reports that Chinese virologists at the Wuhan Institute of Virology have developed mosquitoes carrying vaccines to immunize bats against rabies and Nipah virus. Experimental results indicate that bats exposed to vaccine-bearing mosquitoes mount strong immune responses to rabies and Nipah virus antigens. The Wuhan institute allegedly deployed these mosquitoes to induce immunity in bat populations. Analysts warn the dual-use nature of this approach could enable the global dissemination of lethal pathogens, by turning mosquitoes into vectors that deliver modified viruses to wild bats and potentially generate unpredictable, high-consequence viruses. The piece frames this as a potential tool for epidemic or bio-warfare scenarios. Quotes from commentator Tang Jingyuan and other figures describe the technology as turning bats into natural drones and suggest it could be hard to trace. The report also cites political commentary linking the Wuhan lab to pandemic origins.",
